<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="博客信息">
  <section class="profile-card"><div class="profile-topline"><span class="mono">THE GARDENER</span><span class="status-dot"></span></div><a href="<%= url_for('about/') %>" class="profile-avatar" aria-label="关于朝光"><%- cg_flower('tracking-flower') %><span class="avatar-orbit"></span></a><h2>你好，我是<%= config.author %><span>。</span></h2><p>一个向光而行的探索者。<br>观察生活，探索数据；<br>理解市场，也理解自己。</p><div class="profile-stats"><a href="<%= url_for('archives/') %>"><b><%= String(site.posts.length).padStart(2, '0') %></b><span>篇文章</span></a><a href="<%= url_for('tags/') %>"><b><%= String(site.tags.length).padStart(2, '0') %></b><span>个标签</span></a><a href="<%= url_for('about/') %>"><b>∞</b><span>份好奇</span></a></div><div class="profile-links"><% if (config.social.github) { %><a href="<%= config.social.github %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub"><%- cg_icon('github') %></a><% } %><a href="<%= url_for('atom.xml') %>" aria-label="RSS 订阅"><%- cg_icon('rss') %></a><% if (config.social.email) { %><a href="mailto:<%= config.social.email %>" aria-label="邮件联系"><%- cg_icon('mail') %></a><% } %><a href="<%= url_for('about/') %>" class="profile-more">关于我 <%- cg_icon('arrow') %></a></div></section>
  <section class="sunlight-card"><div class="sidebar-heading"><h3>今日向光指南</h3><span>DAILY LIGHT</span></div><div class="sun-tracker"><div class="sun-arc"></div><span class="tracker-sun"><%- cg_icon('sun') %></span><span class="tracker-horizon"></span><div class="mini-flower"><%- cg_flower('tracking-flower') %><i></i></div><span class="direction east">E</span><span class="direction west">W</span></div><p>像向日葵一样，<br>把目光交给有光的方向。</p><small><span class="status-dot"></span> <span class="pointer-hint">移动鼠标，看看它的回应</span><span class="touch-hint">向光，是一种生活态度</span></small></section>
  <section class="tag-section"><div class="sidebar-heading"><h3>灵感标签</h3><a href="<%= url_for('tags/') %>" aria-label="全部标签"><%- cg_icon('arrow') %></a></div><div class="tag-cloud"><% site.tags.sort('length', -1).each(tag => { %><a href="<%= url_for(tag.path) %>"><span>#</span> <%= tag.name %><small><%= tag.length %></small></a><% }); %></div></section>
  <a class="rss-card" href="<%= url_for('atom.xml') %>"><span class="rss-card-icon"><%- cg_icon('rss') %></span><span><b>下一束光，不错过。</b><small>通过 RSS 订阅朝光</small></span><%- cg_icon('arrow') %></a>
</aside>
